00:19:59.786 --> 00:20:01.637
Because on the first day when I

00:20:01.637 --> 00:20:02.600
started Zoom,

00:20:02.600 --> 00:20:05.193
I remember only two things I wrote

00:20:05.193 --> 00:20:07.131
on company culture and value.

00:20:07.131 --> 00:20:08.925
And it was the border use

00:20:08.925 --> 00:20:11.716
the furniture, buy two for a table.

00:20:11.716 --> 00:20:13.966
But anyway, so our company culture,

00:20:13.966 --> 00:20:14.956
just two words.

00:20:14.956 --> 00:20:15.763
Very easy, right?

00:20:15.763 --> 00:20:16.514
Very catchy.

00:20:16.514 --> 00:20:19.077
Deliver happiness and meaning.

00:20:19.077 --> 00:20:21.718
And for me, as a CEO of a company

00:20:21.718 --> 00:20:23.863
my number one priority.

00:20:23.863 --> 00:20:25.477
Is to make sure Zoom employee

00:20:25.477 --> 00:20:26.156
are happy.

00:20:26.156 --> 00:20:27.815
I believe if you have happy

00:20:27.815 --> 00:20:29.776
employees, you are going to have

00:20:29.776 --> 00:20:31.519
happy customers, right?

00:20:31.519 --> 00:20:33.520
So I do all I can to think about

00:20:33.520 --> 00:20:34.939
how to make sure Zoom

00:20:34.939 --> 00:20:36.191
employee happy,

00:20:36.191 --> 00:20:38.528
and at the same time employee they

00:20:38.528 --> 00:20:41.040
are going to make a customer happy.

00:20:41.040 --> 00:20:43.380
That's our company culture.

00:20:43.380 --> 00:20:45.522
&gt;&gt; Wow, and it sounds like as CEO

00:20:45.522 --> 00:20:47.664
you have a lot of people to keep

00:20:47.664 --> 00:20:49.379
happy your customers,

00:20:49.379 --> 00:20:51.879
your employers, shareholders.

00:20:51.879 --> 00:20:53.492
What happens when one of these

00:20:53.492 --> 00:20:55.435
stakeholder groups isn't happy?

00:20:55.435 --> 00:20:56.934
How do you keep them on board?

00:20:56.934 --> 00:20:58.871
&gt;&gt; So first of all, we should tell

00:20:58.871 --> 00:21:00.956
them why was the purpose of life,

00:21:00.956 --> 00:21:01.486
right?

00:21:01.486 --> 00:21:03.320
The purpose of life is really about

00:21:03.320 --> 00:21:04.465
happiness, right?

00:21:04.465 --> 00:21:06.878
And also the sustainable happiness

00:21:06.878 --> 00:21:08.970
comes from making others happy

00:21:08.970 --> 00:21:09.537
right?

00:21:09.537 --> 00:21:11.352
And for those shareholders, right?

00:21:11.352 --> 00:21:13.093
Like a stock price is down they're

00:21:13.093 --> 00:21:14.953
not happy with tell them, Hey, this

00:21:14.953 --> 00:21:16.707
is more short term thing, right?

00:21:16.707 --> 00:21:17.788
And a plus and

00:21:17.788 --> 00:21:20.443
we should have communicate with

00:21:20.443 --> 00:21:23.490
them very well about why let's say,

00:21:23.490 --> 00:21:25.768
you want to buy Zoom stock.

00:21:25.768 --> 00:21:28.142
Why you become a stakeholder,

00:21:28.142 --> 00:21:28.785
right?

00:21:28.785 --> 00:21:30.612
And ultimately we want to make sure

00:21:30.612 --> 00:21:31.494
the employees or

00:21:31.494 --> 00:21:33.384
shareholders and retool and extend

00:21:33.384 --> 00:21:35.988
our company innovation, right?

00:21:35.988 --> 00:21:38.965
When you look at it the short term

00:21:38.965 --> 00:21:40.516
stuff, right?

00:21:40.516 --> 00:21:42.062
And if we do not understand

00:21:42.062 --> 00:21:43.960
the purpose of life is just focus

00:21:43.960 --> 00:21:46.226
on the short term happiness, right?

00:21:46.226 --> 00:21:47.973
For sure that's not our

00:21:47.973 --> 00:21:49.636
company the culture.

00:21:49.636 --> 00:21:51.334
We always think about what you can

00:21:51.334 --> 00:21:52.911
do differently to focus on long

00:21:52.911 --> 00:21:54.922
term sustainable happiness, right?

00:21:54.922 --> 00:21:56.534
Rather than just the short term

00:21:56.534 --> 00:21:57.216
happiness.

00:21:57.216 --> 00:21:59.127
Sometimes employee is just

00:21:59.127 --> 00:22:00.704
to focus on the money or

00:22:00.704 --> 00:22:02.371
the power or the title.

00:22:02.371 --> 00:22:04.549
Those are the short term happiness.

00:22:04.549 --> 00:22:06.231
Longer term why you got to look

00:22:06.231 --> 00:22:07.172
at make sure that

00:22:07.172 --> 00:22:09.001
the happiness is sustainable.

00:22:09.001 --> 00:22:11.319
Always and in the long run,

00:22:11.319 --> 00:22:13.638
make a customer happy, make employ

00:22:13.638 --> 00:22:15.571
happy and down the road I think

00:22:15.571 --> 00:22:17.825
you will get a much better return.

00:22:17.825 --> 00:22:19.243
&gt;&gt; And keeping on that happiness

00:22:19.243 --> 00:22:20.661
thing because I think it's so

00:22:20.661 --> 00:22:22.256
unique to who you are as a person.

00:22:22.256 --> 00:22:24.120
Something else that we think a lot

00:22:24.120 --> 00:22:25.651
about here at the GSB is what

00:22:25.651 --> 00:22:27.527
kind of leader we want to become.

00:22:27.527 --> 00:22:28.680
We have a class where we

00:22:28.680 --> 00:22:29.531
ask ourselves,

00:22:29.531 --> 00:22:31.064
why would someone follow us?

00:22:31.064 --> 00:22:32.223
Given your background

00:22:32.223 --> 00:22:33.931
being an immigrant to the US being

00:22:33.931 --> 00:22:35.944
an engineer, overcoming adversity,

00:22:35.944 --> 00:22:37.713
putting happiness at the center of

00:22:37.713 --> 00:22:39.604
everything, how would you describe

00:22:39.604 --> 00:22:40.900
your leadership style.

00:22:40.900 --> 00:22:42.927
And how has that evolved over

00:22:42.927 --> 00:22:43.777
the years?

00:22:43.777 --> 00:22:46.382
I think of my leadership style for

00:22:46.382 --> 00:22:47.684
sure again, and

00:22:47.684 --> 00:22:50.662
I was very fortunate to live in

00:22:50.662 --> 00:22:51.499
Valley and

00:22:51.499 --> 00:22:54.103
I've been doing my career here,

00:22:54.103 --> 00:22:55.794
had so many mentors.

00:22:55.794 --> 00:22:56.920
Truly helped me,

00:22:56.920 --> 00:22:58.872
shaped my leadership style and

00:22:58.872 --> 00:23:00.972
I think many years ago, I will say

00:23:00.972 --> 00:23:02.698
my leadership style is more

00:23:02.698 --> 00:23:05.041
like a very hands on leader, right?

00:23:05.041 --> 00:23:06.309
And I tried to work so

00:23:06.309 --> 00:23:08.623
hard trying to understand, again,

00:23:08.623 --> 00:23:10.490
this is kind of should have come

00:23:10.490 --> 00:23:11.982
a gap first otherwise,

00:23:11.982 --> 00:23:13.400
I'm not going to spend so

00:23:13.400 --> 00:23:15.341
much time to learn marketing,

00:23:15.341 --> 00:23:17.677
sales and support and the strategy.

00:23:17.677 --> 00:23:19.502
And I learned a lot because I

00:23:19.502 --> 00:23:21.648
really wanted to understand how

00:23:21.648 --> 00:23:23.642
business operates, right?

00:23:23.642 --> 00:23:25.274
And it's more a very hands on

00:23:25.274 --> 00:23:26.096
leadership.

00:23:26.096 --> 00:23:28.103
That's kind of my personal

00:23:28.103 --> 00:23:30.459
style and but later on I realized

00:23:30.459 --> 00:23:32.912
that's not a scalable, right?

00:23:32.912 --> 00:23:35.389
How to delegate some of the burden

00:23:35.389 --> 00:23:37.247
pointed works to a team,

00:23:37.247 --> 00:23:39.812
how to make sure you are surrounded

00:23:39.812 --> 00:23:42.024
by a lot of leaders, probably

00:23:42.024 --> 00:23:44.429
they're even better than you.

00:23:44.429 --> 00:23:46.476
I think I learned a lot otherwise,

00:23:46.476 --> 00:23:48.171
especially over the past two

00:23:48.171 --> 00:23:48.736
years and

00:23:48.736 --> 00:23:50.796
I do not think I can sleep, right?

00:23:50.796 --> 00:23:51.987
Why they've given us so

00:23:51.987 --> 00:23:53.059
many challenges, so

00:23:53.059 --> 00:23:54.614
many opportunities, right?

00:23:54.614 --> 00:23:56.366
That's my leadership style I

00:23:56.366 --> 00:23:58.542
think completely changed, right?

00:23:58.542 --> 00:24:00.630
How to balance between the hands on

00:24:00.630 --> 00:24:02.930
leadership and also the dedication.

00:24:02.930 --> 00:24:04.823
So it sounds like as Zoom scaled,

00:24:04.823 --> 00:24:06.648
you had to adapt your leadership

00:24:06.648 --> 00:24:07.729
style to fit that so

00:24:07.729 --> 00:24:09.093
it could scale with it.

00:24:09.093 --> 00:24:10.858
&gt;&gt; Yeah, otherwise there's no way

00:24:10.858 --> 00:24:12.313
to scale up your business.

00:24:12.313 --> 00:24:14.305
&gt;&gt; Exactly, we talked about Zoom

00:24:14.305 --> 00:24:16.759
pre-pandemic, we talked about Zoom

00:24:16.759 --> 00:24:18.226
during the pandemic.

00:24:18.226 --> 00:24:19.593
Let's look to the future.

00:24:19.593 --> 00:24:21.464
In five years from now what is

00:24:21.464 --> 00:24:23.024
Zoom going to look like and

00:24:23.024 --> 00:24:24.741
what are you excited for?

00:24:24.741 --> 00:24:26.017
&gt;&gt; Five years later,

00:24:26.017 --> 00:24:27.052
Zoom will be for

00:24:27.052 --> 00:24:29.124
sure five years better, and so

00:24:29.124 --> 00:24:30.806
[LAUGH] after five years.

00:24:30.806 --> 00:24:33.188
But anyway, I think from our

00:24:33.188 --> 00:24:35.970
perspective we truly believe and

00:24:35.970 --> 00:24:38.552
in the future from a technology

00:24:38.552 --> 00:24:41.234
perspective, Zoom can deliver

00:24:41.234 --> 00:24:43.717
a much better experience than

00:24:43.717 --> 00:24:46.020
face-to-face meeting.

00:24:46.020 --> 00:24:47.119
You can sit at home,

00:24:47.119 --> 00:24:48.219
I can sit anywhere,

00:24:48.219 --> 00:24:50.228
let's say local Starbucks coffee,

00:24:50.228 --> 00:24:51.328
I shake your hands,

00:24:51.328 --> 00:24:52.817
you feel my hands shaking,

00:24:52.817 --> 00:24:54.793
I give a hug, you feel my intimacy.

00:24:54.793 --> 00:24:56.509
And even if we speak a different

00:24:56.509 --> 00:24:58.425
language, we can understand each

00:24:58.425 --> 00:25:00.274
other and you get a cup of coffee,

00:25:00.274 --> 00:25:02.067
I can enjoy the smell remotely.

00:25:02.067 --> 00:25:03.919
All those technologies will be part

00:25:03.919 --> 00:25:05.531
of our offering in the future.

00:25:05.531 --> 00:25:06.618
At the same time,

00:25:06.618 --> 00:25:08.429
we would like to transform our

00:25:08.429 --> 00:25:11.360
