00:25:11.360 --> 00:25:13.166
Video, voice, team chat,

00:25:13.166 --> 00:25:14.898
conference room systems,

00:25:14.898 --> 00:25:17.157
events webinar, and also all other

00:25:17.157 --> 00:25:18.976
collaboration solutions.

00:25:18.976 --> 00:25:21.632
Essentially, the end user, they can

00:25:21.632 --> 00:25:23.873
live within the Zoom platform,

00:25:23.873 --> 00:25:25.948
can get most of the work done,

00:25:25.948 --> 00:25:28.355
rather than always switching back

00:25:28.355 --> 00:25:31.010
and forth to other applications.

00:25:31.010 --> 00:25:32.270
The switching cost is very

00:25:32.270 --> 00:25:33.520
high, right?

00:25:33.520 --> 00:25:35.596
Essentially, Zoom more like

00:25:35.596 --> 00:25:37.926
a hybrid work operating system.

00:25:37.926 --> 00:25:40.457
That's why we are very excited.

00:25:40.457 --> 00:25:41.823
&gt;&gt; I'm excited for that, too.

00:25:41.823 --> 00:25:43.661
&gt;&gt; If any of you like that vision,

00:25:43.661 --> 00:25:45.367
feel free to join us, yeah.

00:25:45.367 --> 00:25:48.560
&gt;&gt; [LAUGH] &gt;&gt; So you kept the world

00:25:48.560 --> 00:25:50.824
connected during a global pandemic

00:25:50.824 --> 00:25:53.169
and brought happiness to millions.

00:25:53.169 --> 00:25:54.173
10, 20,

00:25:54.173 --> 00:25:56.768
even 50 years from now, what do you

00:25:56.768 --> 00:25:59.281
want people to remember about you,

00:25:59.281 --> 00:26:00.469
and about Zoom?

00:26:00.469 --> 00:26:01.530
&gt;&gt; It's good questions.

00:26:01.530 --> 00:26:03.905
I think one thing I really want

00:26:03.905 --> 00:26:04.570
Zoom and

00:26:04.570 --> 00:26:07.420
myself to be remembered is that, if

00:26:07.420 --> 00:26:10.270
someone write a book, they will say

00:26:10.270 --> 00:26:13.690
during the 2020 COVID-19 crisis,

00:26:13.690 --> 00:26:17.300
there's a company called Zoom.

00:26:17.300 --> 00:26:19.619
Truly helped the world,

00:26:19.619 --> 00:26:23.048
truly enabled global connections.

00:26:23.048 --> 00:26:25.349
That's what I want the world to

00:26:25.349 --> 00:26:28.004
remember myself and also the Zoom,

00:26:28.004 --> 00:26:29.685
also all the Zoomies,

00:26:29.685 --> 00:26:32.179
and yeah, that's pretty much.

00:26:32.179 --> 00:26:35.296
But again, and we just started our

00:26:35.296 --> 00:26:38.413
chapter two and we are embarking on

00:26:38.413 --> 00:26:41.316
Zoom 2.0 journey, some more

00:26:41.316 --> 00:26:44.775
exciting stuff down the road, yeah.

00:26:44.775 --> 00:26:46.019
&gt;&gt; Wow, principled and

00:26:46.019 --> 00:26:47.541
purposeful leadership,

00:26:47.541 --> 00:26:49.670
you must be a GSB alum.

00:26:49.670 --> 00:26:51.520
&gt;&gt; Yeah, absolutely, yeah.

00:26:51.520 --> 00:26:53.861
&gt;&gt; So, a final question before you,

00:26:53.861 --> 00:26:56.320
