00:27:00.988 --> 00:27:02.400
And the question is,

00:27:02.400 --> 00:27:04.834
principled leadership is paramount

00:27:04.834 --> 00:27:06.254
at the Stanford GSB.

00:27:06.254 --> 00:27:08.196
What do you view as your role in

00:27:08.196 --> 00:27:10.531
leading with responsibility to not

00:27:10.531 --> 00:27:11.931
only your company but

00:27:11.931 --> 00:27:13.347
