00:27:13.347 --> 00:27:14.290
&gt;&gt; Yes, it's good question.

00:27:14.290 --> 00:27:16.299
So, one thing like Cisco and

00:27:16.299 --> 00:27:18.727
when I was there, the Cisco former

00:27:18.727 --> 00:27:21.157
CEO Chairman John Chambers is such

00:27:21.157 --> 00:27:23.030
a greater leader.

00:27:23.030 --> 00:27:25.070
I learned a lesson from him.

00:27:25.070 --> 00:27:27.883
As a leader, right, when you look

00:27:27.883 --> 00:27:30.600
at the business and organization

00:27:30.600 --> 00:27:33.413
you work for, don't always think

00:27:33.413 --> 00:27:35.653
