00:27:35.653 --> 00:27:37.304
Always think about your

00:27:37.304 --> 00:27:39.038
organization's social

00:27:39.038 --> 00:27:41.513
responsibility, what you can do to

00:27:41.513 --> 00:27:43.080
help the community and

00:27:43.080 --> 00:27:44.860
society, right?

00:27:44.860 --> 00:27:46.847
That's what I learned, that's why

00:27:46.847 --> 00:27:48.576
when it comes to Zoom's value,

00:27:48.576 --> 00:27:50.497
our company value, just one word,

00:27:50.497 --> 00:27:51.713
care, they care about

00:27:51.713 --> 00:27:53.828
the community, customer, company,

00:27:53.828 --> 00:27:56.090
teammates, as well as ourselves.

00:27:56.090 --> 00:27:57.125
To care about community,

00:27:57.125 --> 00:27:58.820
that's extremely important.

00:27:58.820 --> 00:28:00.162
Make sure your business,

00:28:00.162 --> 00:28:01.260
your organization,

00:28:01.260 --> 00:28:03.030
is part of a society.

00:28:03.030 --> 00:28:04.374
You think about how you

00:28:04.374 --> 00:28:06.540
can play differently, right?

00:28:06.540 --> 00:28:08.280
Not only think about day-to-day

00:28:08.280 --> 00:28:10.360
