00:28:14.580 --> 00:28:16.433
&gt;&gt; Spoken as a true GSB alum,

00:28:16.433 --> 00:28:17.028
[LAUGH].

00:28:17.028 --> 00:28:17.717
&gt;&gt; Thank you.

00:28:17.717 --> 00:28:18.472
&gt;&gt; We are now going to move- &gt;&gt; I

00:28:18.472 --> 00:28:19.786
have a positive test, right,

00:28:19.786 --> 00:28:21.156
to be a very qualified GSB alum.

00:28:21.156 --> 00:28:22.653
&gt;&gt; 100% &gt;&gt; Thank you.

00:28:22.653 --> 00:28:23.641
&gt;&gt; Passed with flying colors.

00:28:23.641 --> 00:28:24.671
&gt;&gt; Thank you.

