00:28:27.368 --> 00:28:29.291
&gt;&gt; I still remember that particular

00:28:29.291 --> 00:28:31.763
day, October 27, 2020, when I was

00:28:31.763 --> 00:28:33.754
in China, having a Zoom interview

00:28:33.754 --> 00:28:35.815
with Harvard Business School, and

00:28:35.815 --> 00:28:37.050
right in the middle of

00:28:37.050 --> 00:28:39.809
the interview, &gt;&gt; [LAUGH] &gt;&gt; No,

00:28:39.809 --> 00:28:41.624
the severe connection issue or

00:28:41.624 --> 00:28:43.789
censorship that might have captured

00:28:43.789 --> 00:28:45.393
my twisted sense of humor,

00:28:45.393 --> 00:28:47.416
whatever it was, forcibly shut me

00:28:47.416 --> 00:28:48.671
out of the meeting and

00:28:48.671 --> 00:28:50.446
never allow me to log back in.

00:28:50.446 --> 00:28:51.214
And a month later,

00:28:51.214 --> 00:28:52.414
I received a rejection letter

00:28:52.414 --> 00:28:53.717
from Harvard Business School.

00:28:53.717 --> 00:28:55.470
&gt;&gt; [LAUGH] &gt;&gt; Which spurred me to

00:28:55.470 --> 00:28:57.455
apply for the even better business

00:28:57.455 --> 00:28:59.303
school, Stanford GSB, where I

00:28:59.303 --> 00:29:01.437
proudly find myself at this moment.

00:29:01.437 --> 00:29:03.617
And I really appreciate Zoom for

00:29:03.617 --> 00:29:05.716
having changed my path in a very

00:29:05.716 --> 00:29:06.937
meaningful way.

00:29:06.937 --> 00:29:09.728
&gt;&gt; [LAUGH]

00:29:09.728 --> 00:29:15.865
[APPLAUSE] &gt;&gt; Anyway, so regardless

00:29:15.865 --> 00:29:18.120
of the countless efforts made by

00:29:18.120 --> 00:29:20.374
Zoom to improve the security and

00:29:20.374 --> 00:29:22.630
transparencies, I think there

00:29:22.630 --> 00:29:24.966
are still not a few people who have

00:29:24.966 --> 00:29:27.472
concerns over Zoom's association

00:29:27.472 --> 00:29:29.412
with Chinese government.

00:29:29.412 --> 00:29:31.156
And in fact some organizations

00:29:31.156 --> 00:29:33.370
including the Taiwanese government,

00:29:33.370 --> 00:29:34.913
Japanese government, and

00:29:34.913 --> 00:29:36.590
some private company in the US

00:29:36.590 --> 00:29:38.615
still banned official use of Zoom.

00:29:38.615 --> 00:29:40.557
In my view, that Zoom has been

00:29:40.557 --> 00:29:42.815
particularly susceptible to this

00:29:42.815 --> 00:29:45.475
kind of China-related speculations.

00:29:45.475 --> 00:29:47.823
Because of your personal background

00:29:47.823 --> 00:29:50.019
and the fact that Zoom was actually

00:29:50.019 --> 00:29:52.443
complicit in China's censorship and

00:29:52.443 --> 00:29:54.120
repression in 2020.

00:29:54.120 --> 00:29:56.459
So my question is, how would you go

00:29:56.459 --> 00:29:58.720
about reconciling your personal

00:29:58.720 --> 00:30:00.656
identity as a former Chinese

00:30:00.656 --> 00:30:03.333
national holding American passport?

00:30:03.333 --> 00:30:05.416
What's the need for navigating

00:30:05.416 --> 00:30:07.578
multinational tech company like

00:30:07.578 --> 00:30:09.816
Zoom in such complex and sensitive

00:30:09.816 --> 00:30:12.209
business environments shaped by the

00:30:12.209 --> 00:30:14.690
US-China relationship these days?

00:30:14.690 --> 00:30:15.760
&gt;&gt; Yeah, good question.

00:30:15.760 --> 00:30:17.773
First of all, I think that's one of

00:30:17.773 --> 00:30:19.384
the best use cases, right,

00:30:19.384 --> 00:30:20.806
experience about Zoom.

00:30:20.806 --> 00:30:22.048
So how lucky you are,

00:30:22.048 --> 00:30:23.226
you are part of GSB.

00:30:23.226 --> 00:30:24.489
&gt;&gt; [LAUGH] &gt;&gt; And

00:30:24.489 --> 00:30:27.032
I think it boils down to one thing,

00:30:27.032 --> 00:30:27.653
right?

00:30:27.653 --> 00:30:29.458
How to build trust, right?

00:30:29.458 --> 00:30:30.785
This is very important,

00:30:30.785 --> 00:30:32.680
all those issues you just described

00:30:32.680 --> 00:30:34.015
boils down to one thing.

00:30:34.015 --> 00:30:35.713
Because the other side, see

00:30:35.713 --> 00:30:37.624
the customers who never use Zoom

00:30:37.624 --> 00:30:39.761
because of some other government.

00:30:39.761 --> 00:30:41.671
They do not know who we are, right,

00:30:41.671 --> 00:30:43.718
how to establish that trust, right?

00:30:43.718 --> 00:30:46.106
That's why at Zoom, the Speed of

00:30:46.106 --> 00:30:48.760
Trust is our favorite book, right?

00:30:48.760 --> 00:30:50.432
The problem you mentioned, yeah,

00:30:50.432 --> 00:30:51.777
I was born in China, right?

00:30:51.777 --> 00:30:54.284
When pandemic crisis came, a lot of

00:30:54.284 --> 00:30:56.290
us is in the corner of Zoom for

00:30:56.290 --> 00:30:59.570
some mission-critical application.

00:30:59.570 --> 00:31:01.692
They do not know who I am, right?

00:31:01.692 --> 00:31:05.180
And I'm American citizen, right?

00:31:05.180 --> 00:31:05.910
They do not know that.

00:31:05.910 --> 00:31:07.875
They say, Zoom is, maybe it's kind

00:31:07.875 --> 00:31:09.672
of registered in other countries.

00:31:09.672 --> 00:31:11.110
That's not the case, right?

00:31:11.110 --> 00:31:13.257
All those issues, guess what?

00:31:13.257 --> 00:31:15.182
We did not do a good job.

00:31:15.182 --> 00:31:17.836
We should proactively communicate

00:31:17.836 --> 00:31:19.076
with the world.

00:31:19.076 --> 00:31:22.177
Who is Zoom, what kind of

00:31:22.177 --> 00:31:25.437
the company that Zoom is?

00:31:25.437 --> 00:31:27.015
And also what's our company,

00:31:27.015 --> 00:31:28.714
the culture, and the value, and

00:31:28.714 --> 00:31:30.608
mission, all these kind of things.

00:31:30.608 --> 00:31:33.005
We lever that opportunity, right,

00:31:33.005 --> 00:31:35.326
to communicate with whoever may not

00:31:35.326 --> 00:31:37.105
understand our business,

00:31:37.105 --> 00:31:39.038
may not understand our team,

00:31:39.038 --> 00:31:40.680
may not know me, right?

00:31:40.680 --> 00:31:42.184
We lever that opportunity to

00:31:42.184 --> 00:31:42.939
build trust.

00:31:42.939 --> 00:31:44.625
That's why today, you look

00:31:44.625 --> 00:31:46.670
at President Zelenskyy, right?

00:31:46.670 --> 00:31:48.077
He's using Zoom, right?

00:31:48.077 --> 00:31:49.302
And also a lot of government

00:31:49.302 --> 00:31:50.904
that also use Zoom as well, right?

00:31:50.904 --> 00:31:52.643
By so many security companies

00:31:52.643 --> 00:31:53.202
as well.

00:31:53.202 --> 00:31:55.146
Ultimately, that's a way for

00:31:55.146 --> 00:31:57.088
you to always take a step back to

00:31:57.088 --> 00:31:59.700
understand what had happened.

00:31:59.700 --> 00:32:00.989
And then understanding their

00:32:00.989 --> 00:32:02.225
problem, the root cause and

00:32:02.225 --> 00:32:03.930
if there is a good solution.

00:32:03.930 --> 00:32:05.587
I think that's why today we're

00:32:05.587 --> 00:32:07.310
doing pretty well on that front.

00:32:08.530 --> 00:32:11.029
&gt;&gt; I just want to maybe ask you how

00:32:11.029 --> 00:32:13.216
you share your secrets,

00:32:13.216 --> 00:32:14.465
to be such a big

00:32:14.465 --> 00:32:17.600
success as a minority of the Asian?

00:32:17.600 --> 00:32:19.760
And today we also have a lot of

00:32:19.760 --> 00:32:21.740
international student,

00:32:21.740 --> 00:32:24.260
Asian student here, do you want to

00:32:24.260 --> 00:32:26.780
share how to make such a big impact

00:32:26.780 --> 00:32:29.480
as a minority in the United States,

00:32:29.480 --> 00:32:31.910
and please share some advice and

00:32:31.910 --> 00:32:32.994
experience?

00:32:32.994 --> 00:32:35.070
&gt;&gt; I think it's good question.

00:32:35.070 --> 00:32:37.312
First of all, I think again,

00:32:37.312 --> 00:32:39.915
sitting well in America, right,

00:32:39.915 --> 00:32:42.338
cultural wise is where I will say

00:32:42.338 --> 00:32:43.609
is open minded.

00:32:43.609 --> 00:32:45.748
As long as you work hard and

00:32:45.748 --> 00:32:47.602
contribute, right?

00:32:47.602 --> 00:32:50.192
And I think they will embrace you,

00:32:50.192 --> 00:32:50.823
right?

00:32:50.823 --> 00:32:51.933
The community and

00:32:51.933 --> 00:32:53.783
also the business industry,

00:32:53.783 --> 00:32:56.077
I think that's a huge opportunity,

00:32:56.077 --> 00:32:56.596
right?

00:32:56.596 --> 00:32:58.504
I think don't think about

00:32:58.504 --> 00:33:00.586
your background that much,

00:33:00.586 --> 00:33:03.014
just think about what you can do,

00:33:03.014 --> 00:33:05.182
right, to contribute back to

00:33:05.182 --> 00:33:08.280
the community, to society, right?

00:33:08.280 --> 00:33:10.841
If you can show the world,

00:33:10.841 --> 00:33:13.751
you can create a lot of value,

00:33:13.751 --> 00:33:17.137
here you will be very successful.

00:33:17.137 --> 00:33:18.980
Quite often the reason why it's

00:33:18.980 --> 00:33:21.233
not successful, because don't think

00:33:21.233 --> 00:33:23.280
about from other's perspective,

00:33:23.280 --> 00:33:25.191
always think about what you can do

00:33:25.191 --> 00:33:26.610
differently.

00:33:26.610 --> 00:33:27.692
Everyday you become

00:33:27.692 --> 00:33:29.283
better version of yourself,

00:33:29.283 --> 00:33:31.002
you completely get better, and

00:33:31.002 --> 00:33:33.610
also you make the world better.

00:33:33.610 --> 00:33:35.202
And then actually you'll be

00:33:35.202 --> 00:33:37.325
recognized wherever, your business

00:33:37.325 --> 00:33:38.794
also will be successful.

00:33:38.794 --> 00:33:40.669
Ultimately, I think the common

00:33:40.669 --> 00:33:42.543
mistake is because you do not get

00:33:42.543 --> 00:33:44.488
better, your business do not get

00:33:44.488 --> 00:33:46.432
better and you think about,

00:33:46.432 --> 00:33:48.980
maybe actually you're a minority.

00:33:48.980 --> 00:33:50.310
And also there's some

00:33:50.310 --> 00:33:51.430
discrimination.

00:33:51.430 --> 00:33:53.833
I think that's not root cause,

00:33:53.833 --> 00:33:54.459
right?

00:33:54.459 --> 00:33:56.431
Root cause always focus on

00:33:56.431 --> 00:33:59.211
yourself, focus on your business,

00:33:59.211 --> 00:34:01.004
and create more value to

00:34:01.004 --> 00:34:03.437
the society, that's the key.

00:34:03.437 --> 00:34:04.615
&gt;&gt; My name is Jowin Ting,

00:34:04.615 --> 00:34:05.857
I am a second year here.

00:34:05.857 --> 00:34:07.599
My question is about the role

00:34:07.599 --> 00:34:09.704
