00:36:22.368 --> 00:36:24.338
that's a reason.

00:36:24.338 --> 00:36:25.486
&gt;&gt; [LAUGH] &gt;&gt; But anyway,

00:36:25.486 --> 00:36:28.248
I think to build a better solution,

00:36:28.248 --> 00:36:30.548
