00:36:31.929 --> 00:36:34.613
ultimately what's innovation?

00:36:34.613 --> 00:36:36.912
Innovation read about you want to

00:36:36.912 --> 00:36:39.381
be the first company to understand

00:36:39.381 --> 00:36:41.933
customer pain point, and also take

00:36:41.933 --> 00:36:44.315
actions quickly and it will be the

00:36:44.315 --> 00:36:46.801
