00:36:52.650 --> 00:36:55.130
So that's our approach.

00:36:55.130 --> 00:36:56.330
That's the reason other

00:36:56.330 --> 00:36:57.530
competitors, I think,

00:36:57.530 --> 00:36:58.730
they lost, yeah.

00:36:58.730 --> 00:36:59.931
&gt;&gt; My name is Yu Chen Zhou and

00:36:59.931 --> 00:37:01.990
