00:37:01.990 --> 00:37:03.410
My question is what was

00:37:03.410 --> 00:37:05.654
the most frustrating moment in your

00:37:05.654 --> 00:37:07.898
professional career and how did you

00:37:07.898 --> 00:37:09.844
overcome the difficulties and

00:37:09.844 --> 00:37:12.232
what did you learn from it?

00:37:12.232 --> 00:37:14.070
&gt;&gt; That's great question.

00:37:14.070 --> 00:37:18.166
So I think, again, there's too many

00:37:18.166 --> 00:37:22.010
frustration moments in my career.

00:37:22.010 --> 00:37:23.491
Very often in the past,

00:37:23.491 --> 00:37:25.566
however, as a number one thing,

00:37:25.566 --> 00:37:27.861
you got to calm down, that's very,

00:37:27.861 --> 00:37:28.988
very important.

00:37:28.988 --> 00:37:31.014
Because to be a CEO, the most

00:37:31.014 --> 00:37:33.378
important thing is you want to make

00:37:33.378 --> 00:37:35.412
a better decision, right?

00:37:35.412 --> 00:37:37.265
If you do not calm down and

00:37:37.265 --> 00:37:39.471
if you're very frustrated,

00:37:39.471 --> 00:37:41.766
very likely you're going to make

00:37:41.766 --> 00:37:43.390
a wrong decision.

00:37:43.390 --> 00:37:45.520
That's very important, you got to

00:37:45.520 --> 00:37:47.224
make sure, take step back,

00:37:47.224 --> 00:37:49.354
calm down, make sure you always try

00:37:49.354 --> 00:37:50.987
to make a better decision,

00:37:50.987 --> 00:37:53.230
that's number one thing.

00:37:53.230 --> 00:37:54.760
Number two thing is,

00:37:54.760 --> 00:37:57.280
at Zoom, we also have a formula.

00:37:57.280 --> 00:38:00.170
The problem, root cause, solution.

00:38:00.170 --> 00:38:02.015
Frustration will not have you

00:38:02.015 --> 00:38:03.275
anything, right?

00:38:03.275 --> 00:38:04.821
Every time you see the problem,

00:38:04.821 --> 00:38:06.537
right, and huge problem, right,

00:38:06.537 --> 00:38:08.323
you've probably feel frustrated.

00:38:08.323 --> 00:38:09.887
You got to take a step back,

00:38:09.887 --> 00:38:11.998
just focus on problem, root cause,

00:38:11.998 --> 00:38:12.894
and solution.

00:38:12.894 --> 00:38:14.125
And you think about,

00:38:14.125 --> 00:38:16.110
if you can have a better solution,

00:38:16.110 --> 00:38:16.871
guess what?

00:38:16.871 --> 00:38:18.478
You are going to become better

00:38:18.478 --> 00:38:19.830
company.

00:38:19.830 --> 00:38:21.669
And every time you think, wow,

00:38:21.669 --> 00:38:23.646
because there's a problem, Zoom

00:38:23.646 --> 00:38:25.828
will get better tomorrow, I'm going

00:38:25.828 --> 00:38:27.886
to become better leader tomorrow.

00:38:27.886 --> 00:38:29.416
Then you should be happier, right?

00:38:29.416 --> 00:38:31.313
Why you feel frustrated?

00:38:31.313 --> 00:38:32.555
And that's my principal

00:38:32.555 --> 00:38:34.154
&gt;&gt; I'm Eb Shetta, an MBA too,

00:38:34.154 --> 00:38:36.089
you talked about the importance of

00:38:36.089 --> 00:38:38.024
patience as you were building Zoom

00:38:38.024 --> 00:38:39.305
