00:38:39.305 --> 00:38:40.929
But now that you're a listed

00:38:40.929 --> 00:38:43.029
company, there's also share price

00:38:43.029 --> 00:38:45.061
pressures, there's pressures of

00:38:45.061 --> 00:38:46.640
